  "html": "<p>In <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Mania\" title=\"Mutant Mania\">Mutant Mania</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Token_Vendors\" title=\"Token Vendors\">Token Vendors</a> drop <b>Tokens</b>. Those sit on the floor, deal elemental damage, and can heal <a href=\"/wiki/Manglefeet\" title=\"Manglefeet\">Manglefeet</a>.</p>\n<p>This is not a <a href=\"/wiki/King's_Coins\" title=\"King's Coins\">King's Coin</a> and not the Townston <a href=\"/wiki/Token_Masters\" title=\"Token Masters\">Token Masters</a>.</p>\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
